+        target: "wyrd.custodian.reconstruction.audit",
+        action,
+        inode = %object,
+        fault = %fault,
+        "reconstruction could not account for a committed object; its reading of the committed namespace is incomplete, so it drains NO obligation on that evidence and certifies NOTHING until this record is repaired — operator signal",
